      "problem": "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\sqrt{3}/3}(12\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+\\pi ).$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x):$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14189988/assets/fc06a4e63f38a315dd3944f65f871cca2dbdddee26ec268e857f79e5f4ab8848.png)\n\nThe domain of $\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)$ is $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$  \n\nNow, substituting $x=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ directly into the limit, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\sqrt{3}/3}(12\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+\\pi ) & =12\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})+\\pi  \\\\  & =12\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\pi  \\\\  & =3\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
